SUMMARY:MIT Music Tech Speaker Series: Andrew McPherson
LOCATION:MIT\, 182 MEMORIAL DR (REAR)\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:Enacted\, not Extracted: Designing and Performing with Music-An
 alytical Concepts This is a talk about designing musical instruments and t
 he delicate interplay of artistic and technical ways of thinking. All inst
 ruments\, and especially digital ones\, entail a balance between design an
 d analysis\, with instruments relying on symbolic or numerical models of m
 usic in order to create it\, as exemplified in the venerable MIDI standard
 . However\, no system is ever devoid of sociocultural context\, and even t
 he simplest technologies when examined in situ can exhibit fascinating com
 plexity.\nhttps://calendar.mit.edu/event/mit-music-tech-speaker-series-and
 rew-mcpherson\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://calendar.mit.edu/event/mit-music-tech-speaker-series-andrew-mcp
 herson
END:VEVENT
